WEBVTT

NOTE UNMASTERED concept only. Timecodes are story beats, NOT synchronized captions to a rendered movie.
NOTE If video is produced, regenerate captions from final spoken dialogue and manually check timing and accessibility.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
A circle of blue fades even while the page stays the same.
Your experience can change without the object changing.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
That is a reason to investigate perception,
not a reason to believe every promise about the mind.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
A twelve-minute listening routine might fit an ordinary day.
An hour's results in twelve minutes would need evidence.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Zen12 describes twelve levels and four listening styles.
These are seller-described features, not proven outcomes.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Try the free exercise and read the independent guide first.
A commercial purchase is optional; earning links require disclosure.
